WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:33.333
In the previous verse,
Lord Krishna described the qualities of 

2
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.041
His devotees and the joy they experience.

3
00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:38.458
Now in this verse, He explains

4
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:42.750
how He responds to their devotion.

5
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.500
He gives them the necessary understanding

6
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.166
and guides them, so that devotees

7
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:52.583
may deepen their connection with Lord Krishna

8
00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:55.583
and ultimately attain Him.

9
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.166
Lord Krishna emphasises that

10
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:07.166
those who serve  Him with
unwavering devotion and love,

11
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.291
He gives them a special understanding,

12
00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:14.500
the understanding they
need to draw closer to Him.

13
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.166
This divine guidance,

14
00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:18.583
called buddhi-yoga,

15
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:20.083
is the intelligence

16
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:24.500
that helps a devotee navigate
the complexities of material existence

17
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.208
and make continuous progress

18
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.958
toward spiritual realisation.

19
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:34.708
Buddhi-yoga can be understood
as the knowledge

20
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:37.458
that aligns one's actions and thoughts

21
00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:40.625
with spiritual goals.

22
00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:42.916
For example, when someone

23
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:44.500
is trying to

24
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.666
solve a puzzle,

25
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:48.916
if such a person is guided

26
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.708
by someone who knows the solution,

27
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:53.458
the process becomes

28
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:55.916
simpler and faster.

29
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:56.958
In the same way,

30
00:01:56.958 --> 00:02:00.416
Lord Krishna gives His devotees clarity,

31
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:03.708
so they can see the larger picture of life

32
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:05.625
and make choices

33
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.458
that bring them closer to Him.

34
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:10.333
Lord Krishna's help

35
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:13.375
through scriptures or teachers

36
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:17.208
is not limited to external guidance alone.

37
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:20.541
It also manifests from within.

38
00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:24.625
Residing in the hearts of His
devotees as Paramatma,

39
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:25.791
Lord Krishna gently directs

40
00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:26.916
their thoughts

41
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:29.625
and actions.

42
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:31.375
He ensures

43
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:34.291
that they avoid obstacles and distractions

44
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:35.500
and stay focused

45
00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.833
on their spiritual journey.

46
00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:41.250
To receive this divine guidance,

47
00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.666
what is needed

48
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:46.583
is sincere and loving devotion.

49
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.083
When a devotee

50
00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:51.500
serves Lord Krishna 'priti-purvakam' –

51
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.458
with heartfelt affection, or with deep love,

52
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:56.125
it pleases Him.

53
00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.958
This affection transforms devotion

54
00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:02.125
from a duty or obligation

55
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:05.625
into a joyful and fulfilling experience.

56
00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:06.583
In return,

57
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:08.875
Lord Krishna responds by removing doubts,

58
00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.375
clearing ignorance,

59
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:12.791
and providing the insight needed

60
00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:15.458
to understand His nature.

61
00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:17.500
That is His response.

62
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.500
This verse teaches us

63
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.958
that spiritual progress

64
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:24.291
is not possible through solitary effort alone.

65
00:03:24.291 --> 00:03:27.083
This spiritual journey requires

66
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:31.250
connecting with Lord Krishna,
accepting Him as the guide,

67
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.708
and following His teachings.

68
00:03:34.708 --> 00:03:37.166
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna will describe

69
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:40.333
His divine nature in even greater detail,

70
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:44.166
giving Arjun even deeper knowledge.

71
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.666
Does the feeling

72
00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:53.458
of loneliness

73
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:56.625
ever sometimes

74
00:03:56.625 --> 00:03:59.375
surround you?

75
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:01.666
It feels as if

76
00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:09.250
there is no one to hold your hand.

77
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.250
Why only worry?

78
00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.791
I,

79
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:16.791
I am right here.

80
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:20.541
Within your heart, always

81
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:24.833
ready to help you.

82
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:28.166
I see you.

83
00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:32.791
I understand every struggle you have.

84
00:04:32.791 --> 00:04:35.000
And I

85
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.416
have come to give you the insight

86
00:04:39.416 --> 00:04:41.333
by which you will not

87
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:46.583
only cross the obstacle of this moment, but also

88
00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:49.041
keep moving toward the shelter

89
00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:53.041
of My loving presence.

90
00:04:53.041 --> 00:04:55.000
You know,

91
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.541
just as a true friend

92
00:04:58.541 --> 00:05:00.750
on difficult paths

93
00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:05.000
holds your finger and shows the right direction,

94
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.833
in the same way,

95
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:09.375
devotion to Me too

96
00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:15.041
becomes the guide of your inner world.

97
00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:17.000
Simply

98
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.750
practise devotion.

99
00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.250
From the heart, love Me

100
00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:27.125
and trust Me.

101
00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:29.750
When you turn your feelings,

102
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.708
your mind, your heart

103
00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:36.583
lovingly toward Me,

104
00:05:36.583 --> 00:05:37.916
then I

105
00:05:37.916 --> 00:05:42.583
refine your intellect in such a way

106
00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:45.333
that clear vision

107
00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:48.416
develops within you on its own.

108
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:51.416
I Myself give your reasoning

109
00:05:51.416 --> 00:05:55.583
the right direction.

110
00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:57.875
For example,

111
00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:00.833
when at a crossroads in life

112
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:03.958
you cannot make a decision,

113
00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:07.625
your mind is unsettled.

114
00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:12.708
Then your love for Me, your faith,

115
00:06:12.708 --> 00:06:18.416
will awaken a quiet voice within you,

116
00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:20.333
which will say,

117
00:06:20.333 --> 00:06:22.291
'Yes.

118
00:06:22.291 --> 00:06:25.166
This decision is right.'

119
00:06:25.166 --> 00:06:28.500
And you will find your answer.

120
00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.083
You are never alone.

121
00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:34.666
My guidance,

122
00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:39.000
My friendship is always there

123
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:44.083
for those who call on Me sincerely.

124
00:06:44.083 --> 00:06:47.500
Trust Me.

125
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.166
You will receive strength,

126
00:06:50.166 --> 00:06:53.000
the right direction,

127
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.000
and peace of mind too.

128
00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:03.000
Family life

129
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.250
is a long journey together.

130
00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.125
You travel in the vehicle of the family,

131
00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:12.958
seated side by side.

132
00:07:12.958 --> 00:07:15.625
Along this journey, favourable

133
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:18.916
and difficult moments keep coming.

134
00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:23.250
Sometimes there are problems on the road,
sometimes the weather turns harsh,

135
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.083
and sometimes the vehicle itself breaks down.

136
00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:32.041
Moving the journey forward
sometimes becomes difficult.

137
00:07:32.041 --> 00:07:33.125
But

138
00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:36.458
if all the passengers of this family vehicle

139
00:07:36.458 --> 00:07:39.958
come together to find a solution,

140
00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:42.458
the vehicle moves again.

141
00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:46.166
To keep this family vehicle running,

142
00:07:46.166 --> 00:07:51.750
if you centre your heart in Me,

143
00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.875
then I give you

144
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:57.416
the clarity to make the right decisions.

145
00:07:57.416 --> 00:07:59.750
I give you the strength

146
00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.750
to bear challenges with patience,

147
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:07.458
and the understanding to
move forward together.

148
00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:09.250
See –

149
00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.833
when there are different views in the family,

150
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:17.208
such as about the children's future or about

151
00:08:17.208 --> 00:08:20.750
some social responsibility,

152
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.750
then collective surrender to Me

153
00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:27.375
gives everyone a shared understanding.

154
00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:31.166
Together they make the right decision,

155
00:08:31.166 --> 00:08:35.250
one that holds the good of all within it.

156
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.791
Into your family life,

157
00:08:37.791 --> 00:08:40.416
bring the essence of devotion,

158
00:08:40.416 --> 00:08:44.041
not just as a ritual or formality,

159
00:08:44.041 --> 00:08:48.500
but as a deep,

160
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.833
loving relationship with Me.

161
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:54.791
Try this.

162
00:08:54.791 --> 00:08:56.083
Then even in

163
00:08:56.083 --> 00:09:00.083
the most difficult times, the vehicle of your

164
00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:04.208
family life will keep moving swiftly

165
00:09:04.208 --> 00:09:06.791
toward its auspicious destination.

166
00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:15.666
Getting confused when making decisions

167
00:09:15.666 --> 00:09:17.875
is an important part

168
00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:20.916
of the journey of leadership.

169
00:09:20.916 --> 00:09:23.500
You would agree.

170
00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.416
In such moments,

171
00:09:25.416 --> 00:09:28.125
you rely on your knowledge, experience,

172
00:09:28.125 --> 00:09:30.958
and facts,

173
00:09:30.958 --> 00:09:33.166
which is right.

174
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:39.291
But there is another extraordinar
 power within you.

175
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:41.333
Think,

176
00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:47.125
think a little more, a little more.

177
00:09:47.125 --> 00:09:49.791
Me.

178
00:09:49.791 --> 00:09:54.250
Just as an X-ray reveals

179
00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:59.000
hidden problems in the body
without surgery, in the same way,

180
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.458
through a devotion-centred
consciousness toward Me,

181
00:10:02.458 --> 00:10:09.166
you are able to see hidden problems clearly too.

182
00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:11.916
If, to centre your consciousness

183
00:10:11.916 --> 00:10:14.458
on Me,

184
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:18.750
you take a few moments, just a few moments,

185
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.333
then you will experience

186
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:25.333
how, from within you, clarity

187
00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:29.583
and a fresh source of inspiration spring forth.

188
00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:33.041
When your mind is surrounded by doubts

189
00:10:33.041 --> 00:10:37.458
or weighed down by many pressures,

190
00:10:37.458 --> 00:10:42.416
then your devotional connection with Me

191
00:10:42.416 --> 00:10:46.916
acts as an unfailing compass.

192
00:10:46.916 --> 00:10:50.791
It takes you toward a path

193
00:10:50.791 --> 00:10:52.791
that aligns with your values

194
00:10:52.791 --> 00:10:56.458
and the wellbeing of all.

195
00:10:56.458 --> 00:10:59.166
For example,

196
00:10:59.166 --> 00:11:03.291
when you must make a decision

197
00:11:03.291 --> 00:11:07.041
where one side offers immediate gain

198
00:11:07.041 --> 00:11:09.250
and the other holds

199
00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.708
to long-term principles,

200
00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:16.583
when you must choose between the two,

201
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:17.666
or when

202
00:11:17.666 --> 00:11:22.333
you need to bring harmony among team members,

203
00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:23.666
then

204
00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:26.000
remembering Me will give you

205
00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.500
an inner strength

206
00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.750
that points you toward the
right and ethical path.

207
00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.458
But

208
00:11:35.458 --> 00:11:40.166
this is not about abandoning practical effort.

209
00:11:40.166 --> 00:11:41.958
Not at all.

210
00:11:41.958 --> 00:11:44.250
It is about connecting effort

211
00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.875
with that inner guidance,

212
00:11:47.875 --> 00:11:51.625
which strengthens your confidence

213
00:11:51.625 --> 00:11:55.500
and ensures that your decisions

214
00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:59.458
are sound and principled.

215
00:11:59.458 --> 00:12:02.125
Merely sitting under an apple tree

216
00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:06.208
with mouth open and wishing

217
00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:11.000
will not make the fruit fall into your mouth.

218
00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.375
To get the apple,

219
00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:17.041
the right effort must still be made.

220
00:12:17.041 --> 00:12:19.583
A moment of silence,

221
00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:22.083
a moment of stillness,

222
00:12:22.083 --> 00:12:25.000
which connects you

223
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.000
to this inner treasure.

224
00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:32.000
It not only lifts you out of dilemmas,

225
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:38.125
but as a guide also keeps

226
00:12:38.125 --> 00:12:40.666
your energy

227
00:12:40.666 --> 00:12:43.083
and your confidence sustained.

228
00:12:43.083 --> 00:12:46.083
Remember –

229
00:12:46.083 --> 00:12:47.958
I

230
00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:50.541
am here,

231
00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:52.583
with you,

232
00:12:52.583 --> 00:12:56.333
to illuminate your path.

233
00:12:56.333 --> 00:13:01.208
Simply turn toward Me with love.
